<title>USA: NeoRx names Anderson CFO.</title>
<headline>NeoRx names Anderson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>NeoRx Corp Tuesday named Richard Anderson to the posts of senior vice president, chief financial officer and corporate treasurer and secretary.</p>
<p>Anderson joins NeoRx from Mosaix Inc where he was vice president and controller. Prior to Mosaix, Anderson was vice president of finance, chief financial officer and secretary of Merix, where he organized its initial public offering.</p>
</text>
